  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-12",
   "section": "Career",
   "text": "On October 28, Nathaniel was physically assaulted by settlers in the village of Umm al-Khair, Hebron, along with fellow activists Adele Shoko and Andrey X; according to Shoko, Israeli forces pepper-sprayed and arrested him shortly after the incident.",
   "words": 40,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 2"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    40
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
