    "removals": []
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-13",
   "section": "Career",
   "text": "The following day, Shoko reported that Nathaniel and Andrey X had been released but forbidden to enter the West Bank for 60 days.",
   "words": 23,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 2"
   ],
   "author_words": [
